{"unit_id":"M-SX-Xianyu__dsh-agentic-browser#card-zh","repo":"M-SX-Xianyu/dsh-agentic-browser","commit":"2b46b8e9bee93bda5e7dbcdffe56de5fd21a139a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Agent 浏览器（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在 DSH 右侧栏提供由 Agent 驱动的网页浏览面板。它通过 Host 工具和 Client 侧栏面板之间的命令通道，控制嵌入式网页标签。主要功能包括打开和切换标签、读取页面状态、点击与输入、批量执行浏览器操作，以及查看导航历史和截图。适合希望让 DSH Agent 浏览网页并完成常见页面交互的用户。需要 DSH Desktop 浏览器运行时，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:936-971","index.js:1022-1084","index.js:1327-1348","client.js:1869-1884"]}
{"unit_id":"M-SX-Xianyu__dsh-agentic-browser#card-en","repo":"M-SX-Xianyu/dsh-agentic-browser","commit":"2b46b8e9bee93bda5e7dbcdffe56de5fd21a139a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Agent Browser adds an Agent-driven browser panel to DSH's Web sidebar. Host tools control embedded tabs through the Client panel. Agents can open tabs, inspect pages, click and type, batch actions, and view history or screenshots. It requires the DSH Desktop browser runtime and no extra API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:936-971","index.js:1022-1084","index.js:1327-1348","client.js:1869-1884"]}
